    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The [`count`](argeometrysource/count.md) equals the total number of vertices.",
      "ko": "[`count`](argeometrysource/count.md)는 정점의 총 수와 같습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c242d7a4051ce2891530b9b8b73fe4cff10bc5d1f738b442f1e81bb517ea1daf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Since each vertex is the type `SIMD3<Float>`, [`componentsPerVector`](argeometrysource/componentspervector.md) is three.",
      "ko": "각 정점이 `SIMD3<Float>` 타입이므로 [`componentsPerVector`](argeometrysource/componentspervector.md)는 3입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "14cc4eb012cf8949f65afcd1a5fc602878520992c08968079f1639f46a4ccff4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The following code demonstrates retrieving a vertex at a particular index.",
      "ko": "다음 코드는 특정 인덱스의 정점을 검색하는 예입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3130246eac20aa546d56b15a97ccb7d903a4c776016eb51c7f20bb63ab44b330",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nextension ARMeshGeometry { \n    func vertex(at index: UInt32) -> SIMD3<Float> {\n        assert(vertices.format == MTLVertexFormat.float3, \"Expected three floats (twelve bytes) per vertex.\")\n        let vertexPointer = vertices.buffer.contents().advanced(by: vertices.offset + (vertices.stride * Int(index)))\n        let vertex = vertexPointer.assumingMemoryBound(to: SIMD3<Float>.self).pointee\n        return vertex\n    }\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nextension ARMeshGeometry { \n    func vertex(at index: UInt32) -> SIMD3<Float> {\n        assert(vertices.format == MTLVertexFormat.float3, \"Expected three floats (twelve bytes) per vertex.\")\n        let vertexPointer = vertices.buffer.contents().advanced(by: vertices.offset + (vertices.stride * Int(index)))\n        let vertex = vertexPointer.assumingMemoryBound(to: SIMD3<Float>.self).pointee\n        return vertex\n    }\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "01a2108d3f04b5bb671ce2d531b884f99f0eacecb2dbaf4f2400420c8430bc46",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
